          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Cobra Stance].</p><hr /><p>You slightly dislocate your joints to lash out with devious intent and the power to envenom your foe. Make a cobra fang Strike. Your reach with this Strike is 5 feet greater than normal. If this Strike hits, the persistent poison damage from your venomous trait increases to @Damage[1d4[persistent,poison]] damage per weapon damage die.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you have this feat, the circumstance bonus to Fortitude saves and Fortitude DC granted by Cobra Stance increases from +1 to +2.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "PT1M"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
